---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Tu servicio de internet está suspendido temporalmente." />
  <title>Servicio suspendido · NuweNet</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Outfit', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: #0d1117;
      color: #e6edf3;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 520px; width: 100%;
      background: #161b22;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 64px #00000080;
      animation: fadeUp .5s ease;
    }
    @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
    .card-top {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8514920, #21262d);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .icon {
      width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: #f8514920;
      border: 2px solid #f8514960;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
      animation: pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 #f8514940;} 50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 12px #f8514900;} }
    .icon svg { color: #f85149; }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f85149;
      letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: .5rem;
    }
    .subtitle { color: #8b949e; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .card-body { padding: 2rem; }
    .info-row {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .75rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: #21262d; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: .75rem;
    }
    .info-row svg { color: #8b949e; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
    .info-row p { font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #e6edf3; }
    .info-row strong { color: #58a6ff; }
    .btn-portal {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: .5rem;
      width: 100%; margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: .8rem 1.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f6feb, #58a6ff);
      color: #fff; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 600;
      border: none; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
      transition: opacity .2s;
    }
    .btn-portal:hover { opacity: .9; }
    footer { margin-top: 2rem; color: #8b949e; font-size: .8rem; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-top">
      <div class="icon">
        <svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7">
          <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 100 20 10 10 0 000-20z"/>
          <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1>Servicio Suspendido</h1>
      <p id="notice-message" class="subtitle">Tu conexión a internet ha sido suspendida temporalmente. Comunícate con la administración de tu edificio para regularizar tu situación.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="info-row">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        <p>El servicio se restablecerá automáticamente una vez que el administrador confirme tu pago o levante la restricción.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-row">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 10.81 19.79 19.79 0 01.01 2.18 2 2 0 012 0h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 7.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 14.92z"/></svg>
        <p>Contacta al administrador de tu edificio o accede a tu <strong>portal de autoservicio</strong> para reportar tu pago.</p>
      </div>
      <p id="admin-contact"></p><p>Usa el enlace privado que te entregó la administración para abrir tu cuenta.</p>
      <a href="/portal" id="portal-link" class="btn-portal">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
        Ir a mi Portal de Autoservicio
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <footer>NuweNet · Sistema de Administración de Red</footer>
  <script>
    const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search),token=params.get('token');
    const link=document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#portal-link');
    if(link){link.hidden=!token;if(token)link.href=`/portal?token=${encodeURIComponent(token)}`;}
    fetch('/api/portal/notice?building_id='+encodeURIComponent(params.get('building_id')||'')).then(r=>r.json()).then(data=>{
      const message=document.getElementById('notice-message'),contact=document.getElementById('admin-contact');
      if(message && data.message)message.textContent=data.message;if(contact)contact.textContent=data.contact||'';
    }).catch(()=>{});
  </script>
</body>
</html>
